{"id":"H4648","lemma":"מְפִיבֹשֶׁת","transliteration":"mephivoshet","sayIt":"me-phi-VO-shet","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Mephibosheth","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 2Sa.4.4;\nson of: Jonathan (H3083H);\nfather of: Micah (H4318H); also called Merib-baal at 1Ch.8.34; 9.40;\n§ Mephibosheth = \"exterminating the idol\"\n1) grandson of Saul and son of Rizpah the daughter of Aiah, Saul's concubine; he and his brother Armoni were among the 7 victims surrendered by David to the Gibeonites to avert a famine\n2) son of Jonathan and grandson of Saul\n2a) also 'Merib-baal'","glosses":["mephibosheth","so mephibosheth","when mephibosheth","then mephibosheth"],"count":13,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"2sa-4","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"was Mephibosheth","kjv":"was Mephibosheth"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-9","v":6,"renderings":{"bsb":"And when Mephibosheth","kjv":"Now when Mephibosheth"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-9","v":10,"renderings":{"bsb":"But Mephibosheth","kjv":"but Mephibosheth"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-9","v":11,"renderings":{"bsb":"So Mephibosheth","kjv":"As for Mephibosheth"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-9","v":12,"renderings":{"bsb":"And Mephibosheth","kjv":"And Mephibosheth"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-9","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"So Mephibosheth","kjv":"So Mephibosheth"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-16","v":1,"renderings":{"kjv":"of Mephibosheth"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-16","v":4,"renderings":{"kjv":"thine are all that pertained unto Mephibosheth"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-19","v":24,"renderings":{"bsb":"Then Mephibosheth","kjv":"And Mephibosheth"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-19","v":25,"renderings":{"bsb":"Mephibosheth","kjv":"Mephibosheth"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-19","v":30,"renderings":{"bsb":"And Mephibosheth","kjv":"And Mephibosheth"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-21","v":7,"renderings":{"kjv":"Mephibosheth"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-21","v":8,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Mephibosheth","kjv":"and Mephibosheth"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"2 Samuel 4:4","note":"Now Jonatha